                                "sense_id": "d2031c1f-4881-349d-be3e-9129b71a6a35",
                                "text": "\"Them hosses are feeling their oats,\" said McGuire. \"Can't tell what they'd be up to the minute I turned my back on 'em. Might jump that old fence and be off, for all I know.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe20b3e0-2c8b-43bb-9d23-1e911945d7ca",
                                "sense_id": "d2031c1f-4881-349d-be3e-9129b71a6a35",
                                "text": "“That ole black hoss let out a whinny.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
