                                "sense_id": "4194a090-a1a7-30c0-808f-e0c1654700b6",
                                "text": "So here I was, fondling all sorts of fine mats, when a hoss of a woman screeched into her cell phone, rattling the lamps in the light fixture aisle."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
